# Default Function Parameters ⚙️

Set default values for parameters if they are omitted or `undefined`:

```javascript
function sendNotification(message, priority = "Normal", sound = true) {
  console.log(`Notification [${priority}]: "${message}" (Sound: ${sound})`);
}

sendNotification("Server update available");
sendNotification("System Error!", "URGENT", false);
```

