# Rest Parameters (`...args`) 🧺

The rest parameter syntax gathers an indefinite number of arguments into a real JavaScript array:

```javascript
function calculateSum(...numbers) {
  // 'numbers' is a true array!
  return numbers.reduce((total, num) => total + num, 0);
}

console.log("Sum 1:", calculateSum(10, 20));
console.log("Sum 2:", calculateSum(1, 2, 3, 4, 5));
```

