# Immediately Invoked Function Expressions (IIFE) ⚡

An IIFE is a function that runs immediately as soon as it is defined:

```javascript
(function() {
  const secretApiKey = "abc-123-super-secret";
  console.log("IIFE executed! Key is locked in private scope.");
})();
```

<!-- FULL_CODE_START
