  const secretApiKey = "abc-123-super-secret";
  console.log("IIFE executed! Key is safely encapsulated:", secretApiKey.slice(0, 7) + "...");
})();
FULL_CODE_END -->

Historically used to prevent polluting the global window object before ES modules arrived.
